  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Entrepreneurs Week 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Semaine des jeunes entrepreneurs&quot; (Young Entrepreneurs Week) is an annual event to promote youth entrepreneurship in Chad. During this activity, conferences, workshops, trainings and networking sessions are organised to inspire, train, raise awareness and support young entrepreneurs in the development of their business/project. This week offers opportunities for young entrepreneurs to network and share experiences, enabling them to exchange ideas, learn and develop their professional networks. Entrepreneurs will have the opportunity to present their products and services, and to follow a series of training courses that will enable them to develop their businesses. A coaching trajectory for selected entrepreneurs will be organised in follow-up of the event.</narrative>
  </description>
